static constexpr double IMAGINE_SHARED_REFRACTORY_S = 20.0;

// r21-full.3 (Fix 2e): associative recall inside her thinking is OCCASIONAL.
// r21-full.2 recruited a memory on every single thought, which reads as a
// lookup rather than as a mind. A refractory and a coin put it where it belongs:
// sometimes a thought brings something back, and most of the time it does not.
// RECALL_FLOOR is applied to 0.70*topical + 0.30*quality-resonance, so it is a
// floor on genuine topical contact and not on mood congruence.
//
// The refractory is one DMN period, not the 90 s the fix plan first named: the
// plan's own acceptance criterion is a 25-65% recruitment rate, and at the
// measured ~11 s mean interval between requests a 90 s refractory caps the rate
// at ~10% — the two numbers cannot both hold. RECALL_P is kept exactly as
// specified and the refractory expresses what it is actually for: not twice
// running. Measured over a 2-hour driver across three seeds: 29-33%, every
