//     what her register does when it restates the seed's own hook ("On her
//     mind: <material>. <her last thought>") — the tree's r21-full.3 (Fix 1d)
//     position is that circling one thought is not a loop, and the r21
//     throughput fixture (test_r21_inner_life, "nine tenths of what she thinks
